{"suttaId":"tha-ap547","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[5407,5472],"vripara":"143"},"segments":{"tha-ap547:0.3":"Nandakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap547:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammesu cakkhumā;","tha-ap547:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","tha-ap547:2.1":"“Hitāya sabbasattānaṃ, sukhāya vadataṃ varo;","tha-ap547:2.3":"Atthāya purisājañño, paṭipanno sadevake.","tha-ap547:3.1":"“Yasaggapatto sirimā, kittivaṇṇabhato [kittivaṇṇa bhaṭo (syā. ka.)] jino;","tha-ap547:3.3":"Pūjito sabbalokassa, disā sabbāsu vissuto.","tha-ap547:4.1":"“Uttiṇṇavicikiccho so, vītivattakathaṃkatho;","tha-ap547:4.3":"Paripuṇṇamanasaṅkappo, patto sambodhimuttamaṃ.","tha-ap547:5.1":"“Anuppannassa maggassa, uppādetā naruttamo;","tha-ap547:5.3":"Anakkhātañca akkhāsi, asañjātañca sañjanī.","tha-ap547:6.1":"“Maggaññū maggavidū [so maggavidū (sī. pī.)] ca, maggakkhāyī narāsabho;","tha-ap547:6.3":"Maggassa kusalo satthā, sārathīnaṃ varuttamo [naruttamo (syā.)].","tha-ap547:7.1":"“Tadā mahākāruṇiko, dhammaṃ desesi nāyako;","tha-ap547:7.3":"Nimugge kāmapaṅkamhi [mohapaṅkamhi (sī. syā.), mohamaggamhi (pī.)], samuddharati pāṇine.","tha-ap547:8.1":"“Bhikkhunīnaṃ ovadane, sāvakaṃ seṭṭhasammataṃ;","tha-ap547:8.3":"Vaṇṇayaṃ etadaggamhi, paññapesi mahāmuni.","tha-ap547:9.1":"“Taṃ sutvāhaṃ pamudito, nimantetvā tathāgataṃ;","tha-ap547:9.3":"Bhojayitvā sasaṅghaṃ taṃ, patthayiṃ ṭhānamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap547:10.1":"“Tadā pamudito nātho, maṃ avoca mahāisi;","tha-ap547:10.3":"‘Sukhī bhavassu dīghāvu [dīghāyu (sī. syā.)], lacchase taṃ manorathaṃ.","tha-ap547:11.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap547:11.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap547:12.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;","tha-ap547:12.3":"Nandako nāma nāmena, hessati satthu sāvako’.","tha-ap547:13.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap547:13.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsūpago ahaṃ.","tha-ap547:14.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, jāto seṭṭhikule ahaṃ;","tha-ap547:14.3":"Sāvatthiyaṃ pure vare, iddhe phīte mahaddhane.","tha-ap547:15.1":"“Purappavese sugataṃ, disvā vimhitamānaso;","tha-ap547:15.3":"Jetārāmapaṭiggāhe, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","tha-ap547:16.1":"“Nacireneva kālena, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ;","tha-ap547:16.3":"Tatohaṃ tiṇṇasaṃsāro, sāsito sabbadassinā.","tha-ap547:17.1":"“Bhikkhunīnaṃ dhammakathaṃ, paṭipucchākariṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap547:17.3":"Sāsitā tā mayā sabbā, abhaviṃsu anāsavā.","tha-ap547:18.1":"“Satāni pañcanūnāni, tadā tuṭṭho mahāhito;","tha-ap547:18.3":"Bhikkhunīnaṃ ovadataṃ, aggaṭṭhāne ṭhapesi maṃ.","tha-ap547:19.1":"“Satasahasse kataṃ kammaṃ, phalaṃ dassesi me idha;","tha-ap547:19.3":"Sumutto saravegova, kilese jhāpayiṃ mama.","tha-ap547:20.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap547:21.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap547:22.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap547:23.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā nandako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap547:24.1":"Nandakattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
